WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:19.528
When Clara moved to Leipzig, she didn't know anyone there. She had found a job as a graphic designer in a small agency, and she liked the work straight away. But the evenings were long. After work she went home, cooked something, watched a series and went to bed early.

00:00:19.778 --> 00:00:36.884
Her colleagues were nice, but they had families and little time. At the weekend Clara spent hours on the phone to her sister in Munich. 'You have to do something,' said her sister. 'Find a hobby where you meet people.'

00:00:37.134 --> 00:01:00.677
Clara had sung in the school choir as a child, so she signed up for a choir in her neighbourhood. At the first meeting she was so nervous that she almost went home again. But an older woman called Helga took her by the hand and introduced her to everyone. Rehearsals were every Tuesday, and afterwards the whole group went on to a pub.

00:01:00.927 --> 00:01:19.016
Today, two years later, Clara still sings in the choir. Helga has become her best friend, although she is almost forty years older. 'I didn't stay because of the music,' says Clara, laughing. 'But I do sing much better now.'
